     1092       DISABLE RECT-8 RECT-9 RECT-10 tg-gds-by-am tg-group-by-order fi-days-wt-goods fi-critical-qnty-balance fi-critical-qnty-sale fi-critical-qnty-order tog-1 tog-2 tog-3 tog-4 tog-5 tog-6 WITH FRAME F-Main.
     1093       RUN dispatch ('disable-fields':U).
     1094       RUN set-attribute-list ('ENABLED=no':U).
